   <value currency="USD" value-date="2013-08-30">25000000</value>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">CDC committed $25 million to the Leapfrog Fund II in 2013.&#xA0;The fund makes significant minority investments in portfolio companies, with most investments in the $10 million to $25 million range, but with the potential to provide up to $50 million. The fund manager is targeting a total fund size of $400 million. Our investment is helping the fund manager to provide financial services to up to 50 million customers in developing countries.</narrative>
   </description>
